OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway reopens after lorry crash
OL,4,Acaused fuel spill
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorway has fully reopened after a
OL,7,Fcrash that ruptured a lorry's fuel
OL,8,Ftank.
OL,10,FThe closure was in place on the
OL,11,Fnorthbound stretch of the M3 near
OL,12,FWinchester between junction nine for
OL,13,Fthe A34 and junction eight at Popham
OL,14,Fand the A303.
OL,16,FNational Highways said the lorry struck
OL,17,Fthe central reservation at about 01:00
OL,18,FBST, with about 300 litres of diesel
OL,19,Fspilling across the carriageway.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
