OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway reopens after lorry crash
OL,4,Acaused fuel spill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe motorway was shut throughout the
OL,7,Fmorning while repairs and resurfacing
OL,8,Fworks were carried out, with traffic
OL,9,Fdiverted. It fully reopened at about
OL,10,Fmidday.
